stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> Pending: eligible student requests an open Party
 Pending --> Approved: Host approves before start with capacity
 Pending --> Rejected: Host rejects before start (Full allowed)
 Rejected --> Pending: eligible user submits again
 Approved --> Pending: membership left; eligible user requests again
 Pending --> Pending: duplicate request -> 409; unchanged
 Approved --> Approved: repeated decision -> 409; unchanged
 Rejected --> Rejected: repeated decision -> 409; unchanged
 note right of Pending
 Reopen clears decided_at/by and resets created_at.
 Request never reserves a seat.
 All mutations lock Party first.
 end note
